Proofline licensing scope
========================

This repository is NOT licensed in its entirety under the MIT License.

The MIT License in licenses/Proofline-Contributions-MIT.txt applies only to
original copyrightable contributions authored by Osita Miles, and only to the
extent that Osita Miles holds the rights necessary to license them. It does not
license an entire file merely because that file contains a Proofline modification.

Third-party code, assets, dependencies, and other material are excluded from
this grant and retain their respective rights and license terms. This repository
includes material derived from Gloss: https://github.com/Nutlope/gloss

Applicable upstream license terms for that Gloss material have not yet been
identified. No permission or relicensing of that material is granted here.
